---
<Wrapper
	title="Curriculum Vitae"
	description="Nick Clarkson’s curriculum vitae, covering over 25 years of experience in web development, technical leadership and digital strategy."
	image={pixelImage}>

	<section class="section">
		<Hero
			backgroundImage={heroImage}
			breadcrumb={breadcrumb}
			title="Curriculum Vitae"
		/>
	</section>

  <section class="section measure typography">

    <h1>From building things to leading how they’re built.</h1>
    <p>I’ve spent my career working across development, design and digital leadership — leading teams, shaping digital strategy and turning ambitious ideas into things that can actually be delivered.</p>
    <h2>Want the full story?</h2>
    <p>Download my full CV for a more detailed look at my experience and career history.</p>
    <p><a href="/Nick-Clarkson-CV-2026.pdf" target="_blank">Download my CV</a></p>

  </section>

	<section class="section grid">

    <div class="grid__item grid__item--two-thirds">

      {experience.map(({ from, to, role, company, description }) => (		
        <div class="job">	
          <p class="job__duration eyebrow">{from} – {to}</p>
          <div class="job__details">
            <h3 class="job__title">{role}</h3>
            <p class="job__company">{company}</p>
            <p class="typography">{description}</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}

    </div>

    <div class="grid__item grid__item--third">
			<h2 class="job__duration eyebrow">Awards</h2>

			{awards.map(({ year, award, category, project, company }) => (
				<div class="award">					
					<h3 class="award__category job__title"><span class="award__year">{year}</span> {category}</h3>	
          <div class="typography">
            <p class="award__title"><strong>{award}</strong><br>{company} / {project}</p>
          </div>
				</div>
			))}

    </div>

  </section>

  <section class="section grid">
    <div class="grid__item typography measure">
      <h2>Skills</h2>
      <p>I've worked across a fairly broad range of technologies and disciplines over the years. This isn't an exhaustive history of everything I've used, but a useful overview of the experience I bring to projects.</p>
    </div>

    {skills.map(({ category, items }) => (
      <div class="grid__item grid__item--third typography">
        <h3>{category}</h3>
        <p>{items.join(', ')}</p>
      </div>
    ))}
  </section>
</Wrapper>
